{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_1","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"tl-v1","tool":"ragflow_retrieval","arguments":{"dataset_ids":["b5f5be0e8a9b11f197db2303d7337e37"],"question":"opentelemetry-go pull request #7443 histogram reservoir optimization release status","page_size":10,"vector_similarity_weight":0.3,"similarity_threshold":0.2,"top_k":1024,"keyword":false},"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"chunks\": [{\"content\": \"SyncMeasure/NoView/ExemplarsEnabled/Float64Histogram/Attributes/0-24               431.0n ± 2%   116.3n ±  2%  -73.01% (p=0.002 n=6)\\n\\nSyncMeasure/NoView/ExemplarsEnabled/Float64Histogram/Attributes/10-24              470.9n ± 1%   171.0n ±  5%  -63.70% (p=0.002 n=6)\\n\\n```\\n\\nI explored using a []atomic.Pointer[measurement], but this had similar performance while being much more complex (needing a sync.Pool to eliminate allocations).  The single-threaded performance was also much worse for that solution.  See https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/compare/main...dashpole:optimize_histogram_reservoir_old.\\n\\n**Source ID**: [SRC-PR-05]\\n\\n# Pull Request: Optimize histogram reservoir (open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go#7443)\\n\\n**Canonical URL**: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7443  \\n\\n**Author**: dashpole  \\n\\n**Created**: 2025-10-02T13:56:40Z · **Updated**: 2025-12-15T15:00:11Z  \\n\\n**Collected**: 2026-07-14T14:35:41Z  \\n\\n**State**: merged (2025-12-15T14:59:34Z)  \\n\\n**Branch**: `optimize_histogram_reservoir` → `main`  \\n\\n**Changes**: +173 / -61 across 8 files  \\n\\n**Labels**: —  \\n\\n**Milestone**: v1.40.0\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Discussion (9)\\n\\n**codecov[bot]** — 2025-10-02T13:58:33Z\\n\\n**Source ID**: [SRC-PR-05]\\n\\n# Pull Request: Optimize histogram reservoir (open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go#7443)\\n\\n**Canonical URL**: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7443  \\n\\n**Author**: dashpole  \\n\\n**Created**: 2025-10-02T13:56:40Z · **Updated**: 2025-12-15T15:00:11Z  \\n\\n**Collected**: 2026-07-14T14:35:41Z  \\n\\n**State**: merged (2025-12-15T14:59:34Z)  \\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"syncmeasur noview exemplarsen float64histogram attribut 0 24 431 0n 2 116 3n 273 01 p 0 002 n 6 syncmeasur noview exemplarsen float64histogram attribut 1024 470 9n 1 171 0n 5 63 70 p 0 002 n 6 i explor use a atom pointer measur but this had similar perform while be much more complex need a sync pool to elimin alloc the singl thread perform wa also much wors for that solut see http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go compar main dashpol optim _ histogram _ reservoir _ old sourc id src pr 05 pull request optim histogram reservoir open telemetri opentelemetri go 7443 canon url http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7443 author dashpol creat 2025 10 02t13 56 40z updat 2025 12 15t15 00 11z collect 2026 07 14t14 35 41z state merg 2025 12 15t14 59 34z branch optim _ histogram _ reservoir main chang 173 61 across 8 file label mileston v1 400 discuss 9 codecov bot 2025 10 02t13 58 33z sourc id src pr 05 pull request optim histogram reservoir open telemetri opentelemetri go 7443 canon url http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7443 author dashpol creat 2025 10 02t13 56 40z updat 2025 12 15t15 00 11z collect 2026 07 14t14 35 41z state merg 2025 12 15t14 59 34z\", \"dataset_id\": \"b5f5be0e8a9b11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"074fdd168a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/pulls/opentelemetry-go-7443.md\", \"id\": \"ab8f2a2f20a80a46\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.4328976007150813, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.23834585673583047, \"vector_similarity\": 0.88685167, \"dataset_name\": \"С2WR-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/pulls/opentelemetry-go-7443.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"074fdd168a9c11f197db2303d7337e3